        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How long does a typical Hapur to Crossing Republic move take?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">A standard household relocation from Hapur to Crossing Republic covers approximately 850 km and usually takes 2 to 3 business days, depending on traffic, weather, and any mandatory checkpost inspections. Our GPS‑tracked fleet provides real‑time updates, allowing customers to anticipate arrival times accurately.</p>
