      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What documents are required for an intercity shift between Hapur and Crossing Republic?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Customers must furnish a valid ID proof, address proof at both origin and destination, a signed moving contract, and a copy of the GSTIN for corporate shipments. For vehicle transport, a registration certificate and insurance policy are needed. All paperwork is verified at the first checkpost to ensure smooth clearance.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Is there a flat‑rate option for residential moves on the Hapur‑Crossing corridor?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Yes, we offer a flat‑rate residential package that covers packing, loading, transport, unloading, and basic insurance for 1BHK, 2BHK, and 3BHK moves. The flat fee is calculated based on total volume, distance, and any special handling requirements, providing transparent pricing without hidden surcharges.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How does the 7‑layer packaging protect fragile items during the 850 km transit?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">The 7‑layer system starts with 80‑GSM heavy‑duty bubble wrap, followed by high‑density foam edge protectors, multi‑ply corrugated sheets, stretch film, and custom wooden crates for extremely delicate pieces. Each layer absorbs shocks, resists moisture, and prevents vibration damage, ensuring that glassware, electronics, and heirlooms arrive intact.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Can I transport my car together with household goods from Hapur to Crossing Republic?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Absolutely. Our dedicated two‑wheeler carriers and multi‑car trailers feature hydraulic loading ramps, wheel chocks, and high‑tensile ratchet lashings. Cars are insured separately under the same 100% IRDAI‑approved policy, and they travel in the same container truck, optimizing both cost and transit time.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What are common house‑shifting problems on the Hapur‑Crossing route and how are they mitigated?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Typical challenges include unexpected toll delays, checkpost inspections, and road construction. We mitigate these by pre‑planning routes, maintaining live GPS tracking, and coordinating with local authorities for fast clearance. Our team also carries spare packing material to address any on‑the‑spot damage concerns.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Are there extra charges for e‑Way bill generation or GST compliance on this route?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">The e‑Way bill and GST compliance fees are included in the transparent cost matrix for all intercity moves. There are no hidden surcharges; any additional services such as premium insurance, expedited delivery, or special handling will be clearly itemized in the final invoice.</p>
      </div>
